{"id":97,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Avoid eye contact if you come across one. It will try to put you to sleep by using its pendulum."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"There are some Hypno that assist doctors with patients who can’t sleep at night in hospitals."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"In Alola, Komala is Hypno’s main target. It rarely harms people."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"As a matter of course, it makes anyone it meets fall asleep and has a taste of their dreams. Anyone having a good dream, it carries off."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"While it is an extremely dangerous Pokémon, people who are in need of a good, sound sleep call it their savior."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Hypno holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this Pokémon searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"It carries a pendulum-like device. There once was an incident in which it took away a child it hypnotized."},{"games":["SoulSilver"],"text":"Always holding a pendulum that it swings at a steady rhythm, it causes drowsiness in anyone nearby."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"When it is very hungry, it puts humans it meets to sleep, then it feasts on their dreams."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"When it locks eyes with an enemy, it will use a mix of PSI moves such as HYPNOSIS and CONFUSION."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum in a HYPNO’s hand lull the foe into deep hypnosis. While searching for prey, it polishes the pendulum."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"The longer it swings its pendulum, the longer the effects of its hypnosis last."},{"games":["Silver"],"text":"Always holding a pendulum that it rocks at a steady rhythm, it causes drowsiness in anyone nearby."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Insomnia","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's insomnia prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Forewarn","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can tell one of the moves an opposing Pokémon has."},{"name":"Inner Focus","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's intense focus prevents it from flinching or being affected by Intimidate."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"grassland","color":"Yellow","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":96,"name":"Drowzee","condition":null,"children":[{"id":97,"name":"Hypno","condition":"Lv. 26","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,1],[1,50],[1,93],[1,95],[1,415],[13,29],[17,139],[21,60],[25,244],[32,428],[37,207],[42,94],[47,417],[51,473],[56,248]],"machine":[226,776,34,280,347,109,174,605,38,409,577,227,283,203,797,263,7,374,411,264,492,248,416,447,114,270,506,63,8,286,282,113,67,490,118,417,101,182,60,244,94,917,678,473,240,115,156,184,247,285,214,500,164,241,129,36,269,851,168,9,86,92,885,271,433,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-206","name":"Team Rocket's Hypnotizer","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"206","artist":"Toyste Beach","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-206/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-206/large"},{"id":"sv10-80","name":"Team Rocket's Hypno","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"80","artist":null,"img":"sv10/80"},{"id":"sv6pt5-17","name":"Hypno","set":"Shrouded Fable","date":"2024-08-02","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"17","artist":"Masako Tomii","img":"sv6pt5/17"},{"id":"sv3pt5-97","name":"Hypno","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"97","artist":"Mousho","img":"sv3p